{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "按层遍历二叉树，每一层从左到右观察节点，并把该层最后一个节点加入答案。动画使用示例 1 展示三层节点依次进入视野，最终得到右视图 [1,3,4]。每层只保留最右侧节点，因此时间复杂度为 O(n)，额外空间复杂度为 O(w)，其中 w 是树的最大宽度。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二叉树的右视图</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }\n  body{ padding: 28px; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #fff; font-size:14px; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 24px; color: #b8b8b8; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .panel { margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 10px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 18px; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }\n  .tree { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(58px, 1fr)); gap: 18px 14px; }\n  .node-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 7px; min-width: 0; }\n  .node { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 52px; height: 52px; border: 2px solid #686868; border-radius: 50%; background: #333; color: #d4d4d4; font: 600 17px \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s, box-shadow .35s; }\n  .node-label { min-height: 20px; color: #9d9d9d; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; }\n  .node-wrap.active .node { border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(55,148,255,.18); }\n  .node-wrap.visible .node { border-color: #3794ff; background: #0e639c; color: #fff; }\n  .node-wrap.visible .node-label { color: #75b7ff; font-weight: 600; }\n  .n1 { grid-column: 1 / 5; }\n  .n2 { grid-column: 1 / 3; }\n  .n3 { grid-column: 3 / 5; }\n  .n5 { grid-column: 2 / 3; }\n  .n4 { grid-column: 4 / 5; }\n  .levels { display: grid; gap: 14px; }\n  .level { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(72px, 110px) 1fr minmax(110px, 150px); align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 13px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 8px; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s; }\n  .level.current { border-color: #3794ff; background: rgba(14,99,156,.25); }\n  .level-name { color: #b8b8b8; }\n  .cells { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 9px; }\n  .cell { min-width: 42px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #666; border-radius: 6px; background: #333; text-align: center; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s; }\n  .cell.pick { border-color: #3794ff; background: #0e639c; color: #fff; }\n  .choice { color: #858585; line-height: 1.5; }\n  .level.current .choice { color: #75b7ff; }\n  .status { min-height: 52px; padding: 14px 16px; border-left: 4px solid #3794ff; background: #2d2d30; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .answer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; }\n  .answer-label { color: #b8b8b8; }\n  .answer-cell { min-width: 42px; padding: 9px 11px; border: 1px solid #3794ff; border-radius: 6px; background: #0e639c; color: #fff; text-align: center; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; animation: appear .35s ease-out; }\n  .empty { color: #858585; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .legend { margin-top: 18px; color: #9d9d9d; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }\n  @keyframes appear { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n  @media (max-width: 620px) {\n    body{ padding: 18px; }\n    .panel { padding: 16px; }\n    .level { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .choice { min-height: 22px; }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.intro{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.panel-title{font-size:13px!important;margin-bottom:6px!important}.node{width:36px!important;height:36px!important;font-size:12px!important;border-width:1px!important}.node-label{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.level{grid-template-columns:72px 1fr 88px!important;gap:6px!important;padding:8px!important}.cell{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:12px!important;min-width:32px!important}.status{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;min-height:auto!important}.answer-cell{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:13px!important}.legend{font-size:10px!important;margin-top:8px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>从右侧逐层观察</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">示例：root = [1,2,3,null,5,null,4]。同一层中，最右边的节点会遮住它左侧的节点。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">树的层次结构</div>\n    <div class=\"tree\">\n      <div class=\"node-wrap n1\" data-depth=\"0\" data-value=\"1\"><div class=\"node\">1</div><div class=\"node-label\">第 0 层</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap n2\" data-depth=\"1\" data-value=\"2\"><div class=\"node\">2</div><div class=\"node-label\">第 1 层 · 左</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap n3\" data-depth=\"1\" data-value=\"3\"><div class=\"node\">3</div><div class=\"node-label\">第 1 层 · 最右</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap n5\" data-depth=\"2\" data-value=\"5\"><div class=\"node\">5</div><div class=\"node-label\">第 2 层 · 左</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node-wrap n4\" data-depth=\"2\" data-value=\"4\"><div class=\"node\">4</div><div class=\"node-label\">第 2 层 · 最右</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">按层扫描过程</div>\n    <div class=\"levels\">\n      <div class=\"level\" data-level=\"0\"><div class=\"level-name\">第 0 层</div><div class=\"cells\"><div class=\"cell\">1</div></div><div class=\"choice\">等待扫描</div></div>\n      <div class=\"level\" data-level=\"1\"><div class=\"level-name\">第 1 层</div><div class=\"cells\"><div class=\"cell\">2</div><div class=\"cell\">3</div></div><div class=\"choice\">等待扫描</div></div>\n      <div class=\"level\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"level-name\">第 2 层</div><div class=\"cells\"><div class=\"cell\">5</div><div class=\"cell\">4</div></div><div class=\"choice\">等待扫描</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div id=\"status\" class=\"status\">准备从树的顶部开始。</div>\n    <div class=\"answer\"><span class=\"answer-label\">右视图：</span><div id=\"answer\"><span class=\"empty\">[]</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"legend\">蓝色节点表示当前层从右侧能够看到的节点。扫描完一层后，只把该层最右侧的值追加到结果。</div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const picked = [1, 3, 4];\n  const messages = [\n    '第 0 层只有节点 1，因此右侧看到 1。',\n    '第 1 层依次有 2、3，最右侧节点是 3。',\n    '第 2 层依次有 5、4，最右侧节点是 4。',\n    '全部层扫描完成，结果为 [1, 3, 4]。'\n  ];\n  const levels = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.level'));\n  const nodes = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.node-wrap'));\n  const status = document.getElementById('status');\n  const answer = document.getElementById('answer');\n  let step = -1;\n\n  function render() {\n    levels.forEach((level, index) => {\n      level.classList.toggle('current', index === step);\n      const cells = level.querySelectorAll('.cell');\n      cells.forEach((cell, cellIndex) => cell.classList.toggle('pick', index <= step && cellIndex === cells.length - 1));\n      level.querySelector('.choice').textContent = index <= step ? '选择最右侧：' + picked[index] : '等待扫描';\n    });\n\n    nodes.forEach(node => {\n      const depth = Number(node.dataset.depth);\n      node.classList.toggle('active', depth === step);\n      node.classList.toggle('visible', depth <= step && Number(node.dataset.value) === picked[depth]);\n    });\n\n    status.textContent = step < 0 ? '准备从树的顶部开始。' : messages[step];\n    const shown = step < 0 ? [] : picked.slice(0, Math.min(step + 1, picked.length));\n    answer.innerHTML = shown.length\n      ? shown.map(value => '<span class=\"answer-cell\">' + value + '</span>').join('')\n      : '<span class=\"empty\">[]</span>';\n  }\n\n  function advance() {\n    step++;\n    if (step > 3) step = -1;\n    render();\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(advance, 1900);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(w)",
  "complexity_note": "n 是节点数, w 是最大层宽, h 是树高. 动画按层 BFS 并选每层最后一个节点, 队列最坏 O(n). 不含每层一个值的 O(h) 结果空间."
}
